// AI BASELINE (onboarding) — unit + API test suite.
// Standalone: node test/baseline.test.js  (same harness style as gym.test.js)
//
// Part 1 (unit, in-process): rubric contract, AI response validation,
//   provider failures/timeouts/retries, missing provider configuration.
// Part 2 (integration): spawns server.js against a scratch DB with a local
//   MOCK OpenAI-compatible provider (no external network, no real key):
//   401s, validation, persistence, reassessment, duplicate prevention,
//   confirmed-baseline preservation, provider failure mapping, ownership,
//   onboarding completion, export coverage.
